<title>EGYPT: TENNIS-EGYPT BEAT LITHUANIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP PLAY-OFF.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EGYPT BEAT LITHUANIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP PLAY-OFF.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt beat Lithuania 3-2 after winning the remaining reverse singles in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African Zone group two play-off on Monday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Hisham Hemeida beat Eugenijus Cariovas 6-2 7-6 6-7 5-7 11-9.</p>
</text>
